# URL of the backend server.
# - For local development on one machine: http://localhost:8000
# - For LAN play: http://<host-machine-LAN-IP>:8000 (e.g. http://192.168.1.23:8000)
# - For online play: your deployed backend URL (e.g. https://coup-server.onrender.com)
#
# If you leave this unset, the app will try to auto-detect a sensible default
# based on the page's own hostname (great for LAN play with zero config).
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=
